title: "SS-PEG: Space of States and Projections of the Evolution Graph"
version: "1.0.0"
description: "Experimental program on emergent gauge symmetries from Killing metric geometry. The entire algebraic structure of gauge symmetry commutation relations, Jacobi identities, Casimir operators, dual Coxeter numbers, representation invariants emerges as the unique output of a purely geometric variational principle acting on the Killing metric. No algebraic axioms are required."
